d":false,"updatedAt":"2022-08-27T01:06:00.728Z","creator":{"name":"Trade.","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":1267987945,"name":"SCP-096 Demonstration (Fan remake)","desc":"","path":"/game/1267987945-scp-096-demonstration","slug":"1267987945-scp-096-demonstration","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"playing":0,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":2665326799,"name":"Find The Button","desc":"Welcome to Find The Button!\n\nPrepare for an engaging exploration across our diverse worlds. Uncover hidden buttons throughout this challenging journey. Brace yourself for a an amazing experience!\n\nIn this experience, your goal is to find the button within each level. With a vast selection of more than 900 levels, the fun doesn't stop!\n\nHave you completed the game? Join again tomorrow for a different Daily World! Like, favourite and follow the game to be the first notified when a new update releases!\n\nSupported on 🎮Xbox, 🖥️PC, 📱Phone/Tablet\n\nDon't forget to join the group for a larger daily bonus!\nhttps://www.roblox.com/groups/3948271/Pr-Studio#!/about\n\nCredits:\nOwner: prmoha747\nCo-Owner: Boele009\nBuilders: Useless_Dolphin, Opocty,\nCheck out the in-game credits board to see all the individuals who contributed to our journey!\n\nEnjoy the Experience! - Originally created on 3/3/2018\n","path":"/game/2665326799-find-the-button","slug":"2665326799-find-the-button","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e0dcea23b9f4a922c07cf89e23af42357ddf69aacadf3b0f563f10fee0f8febe.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-71a884ae1897a17499b5a52907efca8f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":112241664,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-09-06T12:20:43.120Z","creator":{"name":"Pr Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":1117315411,"name":"Adventure Story!","desc":"A multiplayer, turn-based action-adventure game set in a cartoony world full of interesting and charming characters. You travel the world to learn powerful abilities in order to conquer the most evil beings with the help of your friends, while collecting treasures and valuable relics along the way.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------\n\n2026 changes:\n- Fixed lots of issues, optimized some things, slight battle improvements\n- Reset dungeon ratings and fixed generation issues with it\n- Increased card drop rates from 1 in 8 to 1 in 2\n- Increased corrupted enemy rates when at max level\n- Fixed fleeing, made some battle camera movements faster\n- Dungeon difficulty is now total of player ratings instead of combined average\n- Dungeon rating on victory is no longer split between each player\n- Endless dungeons now scale faster based on number of players","path":"/game/1117315411-adventure-story","slug":"1117315411-adventure-story","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3582b88df1cfc42930d03145000dafa31426258ba15dafcd022c65fdb35d25cf.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e138e69056e4ab25dcef8c5694e5f643/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":12985164,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-01-16T05:07:32.817Z","creator":{"name":"vetexgames","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":3198259055,"name":"SoulShatters Test Place","desc":"Teleporting to a different server = New Update. Shutdown = Emergency Fix.\n\nIn this game, it's kill or be killed. This is a fighting game, \"randoming\" doesn't exist.\n\nWelcome to SoulShatters! There are many planned changes and features that aren't, won't, may, and will be in the final release.\n\nCurrent Characters Include: Sans, Glitchtale Chara, Storyshift Chara, Undyne, Bete Noire, Asriel Dreemurr, Frisk, XTale Sans/Chara, Delta Sans, Glitchtale Frisk, Sakuya Izayoi, Stevonnie, and Carrot God!\n\nControls:\n\n[LMB/RMB]: Melee Combat \n[F]: Block \n[R]: Teleport/Transportation \n[Left Control]: Run \n[Double Tapping any Movement Key]: Dash (Instantly makes you run) \n[MMB/L]: Lock/unlock your cursor. (Required for certain moves) \n[1-9]: Special Attacks (Will require Mana) \n[Q/E]: Change modes for certain characters. \n\nKeep up to date with changes, updates, and planned features. ","path":"/game/3198259055-soulshatters-test-place","slug":"3198259055-soulshatters-test-place","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c5c2ee7b64b7734f96c574bc4c078d63f0af5058cb8e09274429ab95b9c4267e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-dcdd9494181051a57bc4c5cf0e34ae1a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":162988362,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-10-06T16:33:40.261Z","creator":{"name":"SenatorBunny","type":"User"},"script":{"count":7,"freeCount":7,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":2818280787,"name":"Pet Simulator 2!","desc":"Pet Simulator 2 has been discontinued.","path":"/game/2818280787-pet-simulator-2","slug":"2818280787-pet-simulator-2","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b7d1a83723db1727b7038dfc94fce1d7509110f3f6c7a89d1167ad8b9fe49830.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d4dc92dad152aff499b0cc44269208a8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":102496366,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-02-18T19:16:10.941Z","creator":{"name":"BIG Games Pets","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":2965497514,"name":"Prison Adventure","desc":"Escape the prison, rob, fight with cops OR arrest, protect the city and stop chaos! Choose your way of earning money from a variety of possible. Improve your weapons, buy new cars and freely roam the open world! Play as a criminal, prisoner or police officer! \n\n🎮 PC\nShift - Run\nC - Crawl\nR - Reload\nF - Punch","path":"/game/2965497514-prison-adventure","slug":"2965497514-prison-adventure","thumbnail":{"url":"htt